 \left(\frac y{128},\frac{y(58-y)}{128(y+6)},\frac y{2(y+6)}\right),
$$

the individual error is exactly

$$
e_y=\frac12\left[\|\Lambda_*(\rho_y)-B_y^{\rm ideal}\|_1
 +\sum_\ell w_\ell\int_0^1
 |\operatorname{tr}(M\rho_y)g(t)-6y/(y+6t)^2|dt\right].
\tag{FA.81}
